=== real_anatomy_longitudinal (weight: 0.3) ===
    Longitudinal tracking on real hippocampal anatomy: held-out real hippocampus labels (MSD Task04, manual) are the baselines; each subject's three follow-ups carry hidden, known progressive tissue loss in the head (erosion along the true boundary normals), an independent smooth warp and a new scanner pose. Each submitted baseline endpoint is followed through the known change: the evaluator scores where the same anatomical point is reported on the follow-ups, the measured thickness change of the same spoke, the implied boundary and the measurement validity.

